  "prefLabel": "Adm 214.02 Effect of Declaratory Rulings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 214.02 Effect of Declaratory Rulings. A declaratory ruling shall apply only to the person requesting it and shall be confined to the facts presented pursuant to Adm 214.01.\n\nSource. #8908, eff 9-22-07",
